\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The \textsc  {SecretHandle}{} prototype on Android. (a)\nonbreakingspace The original notification is cancelled and replaced by one naming only the source app and minted handle. (b)\nonbreakingspace On-screen codes are covered by a non-touchable overlay (\texttt  {TYPE\_ACCESSIBILITY\_OVERLAY}), so a screenshot-reading agent sees only the opaque marker while touch events pass transparently.}}{9}{figure.caption.44}\protected@file@percent }
